# p[o1>2]: a linear crossfade between two raw outputs.
# Every other output remains zero. No DBAP, calibration or gain normalization.
# !spk compact XYZ: digits 0..9 map linearly to -1..1 metres.
!t[Across the wires]
!spk[000 900 909 009]
!vs
s110>165v0>2>0'8e0p[o1>2]
t330>220v0>0.8>0'8e0p[o4>3]
2n2v0>0.4>0'6e0f7>2h0.2>4p[o2>4]
